<title>SOUTH KOREA: BYC Co half-year net profit shrinks.</title>
<headline>BYC Co half-year net profit shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 12,562 vs 12,784</p>
<p>    Net					   7.93 vs   8.07</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			12.03 vs  12.71</p>
<p>    Turnover				  148.30 vs 172.28</p>
<p>Note - BYC Co Ltd is one of South Korea's leading underwear makers. The figures were provided by the Korea List Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
